Windows: offscreen render_to_image outside tests

The release self-test (src/selftest.rs) checks that the window draws and saves a
PNG of a failing scenario through Window::render_offscreen. The DirectX
renderer already implements it; only the test-support gate kept it out of
shipped builds, as on macOS before.

